able (pomegranate seeds)","Concern_Level_TCS":"Low","EU_Status":"Permitted","EU_Annex":"","India_Status":"Permitted","US_FDA_Status":"Permitted","Korea_Status":"Permitted","Vegan":"Yes","Natural_ISO16128":"1.00","SVHC_Flag":"No","CMR_Flag":"None","Allergen_Flag":"None","Endocrine_Flag":"No","Max_Concentration_EU":"No limit","Max_Concentration_India":"No limit","Format_Restriction":"Both","Baby_Restriction":"None","Common_Products":"Face oils serums anti-aging products","Key_Safety_Notes":"Unique source of punicic acid (conjugated linolenic acid); potent antioxidant; anti-inflammatory; possible skin cell proliferation support; ellagic acid content (from cold-pressed oil); high oxidative stability relative to other PUFAs","TCS_Evaluator_Flag":"No","Source_Reference":"EU CosIng; Lansky & Newman 2006","Last_Updated":"2026-05-12"},{"INCI_Name":"Oenothera Biennis Oil","CAS_Number":"90028-66-3","EC_Number":"289-917-4","Chemical_Name":"Evening primrose oil","Function":"Emollient / Active (GLA-rich)","Category_Code":"EMOL","Category_Name":"Emollient","Ingredient_Origin":"Vegetable (evening primrose seeds)","Concern_Level_TCS":"Low","EU_Status":"Permitted","EU_Annex":"","India_Status":"Permitted","US_FDA_Status":"Permitted","Korea_Status":"Permitted","Vegan":"Yes","Natural_ISO16128":"1.00","SVHC_Flag":"No","CMR_Flag":"None","Allergen_Flag":"None","Endocrine_Flag":"No","Max_Concentration_EU":"No limit","Max_Concentration_India":"No limit","Format_Restriction":"Both","Baby_Restriction":"None","Common_Products":"Serums face oils dry skin products eczema support","Key_Safety_Notes":"High gamma-linolenic acid (GLA ~8%); GLA is ALA metabolite supporting anti-inflammatory prostaglandin pathway; clinical use in atopic dermatitis (oral more studied; topical complementary); oxidation-prone, packaging antioxidants important","TCS_Evaluator_Flag":"No","Source_Reference":"EU CosIng; Bamford et al.; clinical GLA literature","Last_Updated":"2026-05-12"},{"INCI_Name":"Borago Officinalis Seed